{"id":"c87db4d1858a0009","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-strength.md","title":"相对于共同句子类的后果强度","display":"df-truth-strength — 相对于共同句子类的后果强度","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-strength","aliases":["91-df-truth-strength","91-df-proof-theoretic-strength"],"display":"df-truth-strength — 相对于共同句子类的后果强度","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-theory]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-strength"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-strength</span><span>91-df-proof-theoretic-strength</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-strength — 相对于共同句子类的后果强度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"024b320d234d188f\" href=\"?note=024b320d234d188f\" title=\"91-df-truth-theory\">91-df-truth-theory</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,U\">\\(S,U\\)</span> 为经典理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\operatorname{Lang}(S)\\cap\\operatorname{Lang}(U)}\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\operatorname{Lang}(S)\\cap\\operatorname{Lang}(U)}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C},\\preceq_{\\mathcal C},\\equiv_{\\mathcal C},\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C},\\preceq_{\\mathcal C},\\equiv_{\\mathcal C},\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 为下述唯一后果比较签名。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(S)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathcal C:S\\vdash\\varphi\\},\\qquad\nS\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}U\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(S)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(S)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathcal C:S\\vdash\\varphi\\},\\qquad\nS\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}U\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(S)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}U\\coloneqq S\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}U\\land U\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}S,\\qquad\nS\\prec_{\\mathcal C}U\\coloneqq S\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}U\\land\\neg(U\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}U\\coloneqq S\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}U\\land U\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}S,\\qquad\nS\\prec_{\\mathcal C}U\\coloneqq S\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}U\\land\\neg(U\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里集中定义全部比较关系；层级节点仅构造预序/商偏序，避免循环复用和同名重复定义。\n共同算术后果、全真理语言后果、可解释性与证明论序数是不同比较对象。相同序数不直接给相同算术后果，算术后果相同也不意味着两个真理谓词可定义互译。\n理论名总要附公理版本、归纳、背景逻辑和后果类。原书完整 TB、UTB 对 PA 算术保守，是这个比较的实例。</p>\n<p>来源：§6 末及各系统的强度分析；本地统一后果比较约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-theory","status":"resolved","id":"024b320d234d188f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-theory]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\operatorname{Lang}(S)\\cap\\operatorname{Lang}(U)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C},\\preceq_{\\mathcal C},\\equiv_{\\mathcal C},\\prec_{\\ma